      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Implementation**\n\nI'm now focusing on the specific implementation, the file name `embed_batch.py`, and the need to include code for a batch embedding process. I'm prioritizing the selection of an external embedding provider, as it's the most crucial dependency to make progress on. I need to make sure the provider is concretely present within the code.\n\n\n**Specifying the Provider**\n\nI've determined that Vertex AI is a solid external provider, and I'm integrating the `google-cloud-aiplatform` library. Now, the code will import necessary components from  `google. cloud.aiplatform.matching_engine` and define the `embed_batch` function. This function will initialize a PredictionServiceClient and use a specific embedding model from Vertex AI. Finally, it will return the embeddings for the batch. I'm focusing on crafting the `embed_batch.py` file content now.\n\n\n",
