      "data": {
        "text": "**Selecting Embedding Provider**\n\nOkay, I've decided to use Google Cloud as the embedding provider for the `embed_text.py` script. The next step is to make sure I include the correct identifier for it within the code.\n\n\n**Defining Embedding Process**\n\nI'm now focused on the specifics of generating embeddings using the `embed_text.py` script. The Google Cloud `vertexai` library will be key, and the `textembedding-gecko` model identifier will need to be correctly incorporated. The structure is taking shape: a script using the library to take text and output its embedding vector.\n\n\n",
